{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是没想明白，却不愿再把日子耗在等答案上，先接下眼前能做的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下眼前能做的事\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心被失落压垮，动起来后有了些底气，也为自己还能往前而骄傲，却仍不知道最后会怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"有了些底气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着那些珍惜的东西，却已不能像从前那样拥有，眼下承担的事也顾不上它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不能像从前那样\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕一承认难过就撑不住，只好一遍遍压住难过，越压越难说服自己还能撑住，越逼自己往前越喘不过气。\",\n      \"key\": \"越难说服自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的行动原则落到先接下眼前能做的事上，回应前段对非得想清才肯走的难堪。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来的底气和骄傲，也保留结果未知的事实。S01-2只能解释他不甘心被失落压垮，不能直接推出行动后的底气与骄傲，因此删去这条跨段箭头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把未被照顾的牵挂说具体，并接上前段熟悉却回不到从前的经验，解释珍惜之物为何像遥远的旧歌。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去珠子不支持的投入快乐与不再审视自己的说法，改为压住难过却越来越难说服自己。保留强撑逐渐吃力的变化，但不把B4的比喻落实成真实对白；S01-4也不能直接推出他害怕承认难过就会撑不住，因此删去这条跨段箭头。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e5f407c-7613-47eb-aec8-b4dd75dc67d4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062258978584Z", "elapsed_seconds": 324.546, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:28:23.524518+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67dffdc83b63c9e3537330673fa61323f692da950a1a56a38d69a0c79cf4f0b5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062258978584Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "66dbd473e137c867fce34705ceb7caedbad78ccf355e18ec551c3858d0b4dac6"}}}
